msgid "Hide timeline"
msgstr "Zeitachse ausblenden"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Show timeline"
msgstr "Zeitachse anzeigen"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "How each date is known"
msgstr "Wie das jeweilige Datum bekannt ist"

